sexyz -- Synchronet External X/Y/ZMODEM Transfer Protocols
===========================================================

The NullModem BBS container image ships /usr/local/bin/sexyz, which the
BBS runs as a separate program for Zmodem file and QWK transfers over
Telnet/SSH. It is not part of NullModem BBS and is not linked into it.

Upstream:  Synchronet BBS, https://www.synchro.net/
Source:    https://gitlab.synchro.net/main/sbbs
Commit:    7cf7f2fc56d8383aeb6cd35639977f3815afe7ce (2026-09-19)
Built from src/sbbs3 (sexyz.c, xmodem.c, zmodem.c, ringbuf.c, nopen.c,
date_str.c, telnet.c) with the xpdev and hash libraries, unmodified.

