Corresponding source
--------------------

The complete source sexyz was built from, with the build files, lies
next to this file as sexyz-source-7cf7f2fc.tar.gz. To rebuild it on
Debian (build-essential):

    tar xzf sexyz-source-7cf7f2fc.tar.gz
    cd src/sbbs3 && make RELEASE=1 sexyz

The same tree is also at the upstream commit above.
